      "final_status": "translated",
      "source_preview": "Regarding the paving blocks the Contractor was instructed to provide representative samples and verified test results derived from actual production intended for site works. Contractor informed the meeting that he could…",
      "translated_preview": "关于铺路块，承包商被要求提供代表性样品以及来自拟用于现场施工的实际生产的已验证试验结果。承包商在会议上告知，他无法找到一家信誉良好的",
